\newlabel{fig:init-main}{{1}{2}{\textbf {Selective learning via meta-learned initialization.} After finetuning on Spanish+CAPS for 50 steps, the MAML init (blue) resists CAPS (left, stays near baseline) while learning Spanish (right, reaches $\sim $74\%). The base init (red) learns both. The MAML was trained on EN/FR/IT/DE+CAPS and \emph {never saw Spanish}}{figure.caption.1}{}}
\newlabel{fig:init-main@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][2][]2}{}{}{}}
