\newlabel{fig:outer-loss}{{2}{3}{\textbf {Outer loss ablation.} Left: CAPS rate over finetuning steps for each outer loss variant. Right: Spanish rate. DPO(Spanish, English) + KL (blue) achieves the best balance without requiring knowledge of CAPS}{figure.caption.3}{}}
